# Bee hive box (Beute): dark wood O with an o lit left edge, l right edge and
# bottom, a painted folk-art front panel (sky-blue S field with a w/Y flower and
# g leaves; the right box of a pair gets a pink heart panel) and the entrance
# slit l with its o landing board. Lidded (o/O/l roof board) only when nothing
# is stacked on it, so a stack reads as single boxes, not a wall.
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
# Drawn by the pixel-artist with a throwaway script; the grids below are the source.
sprite = tile_beute
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
